{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Got it. I’ll give you (1) a clear recommendation on layout and (2) a ready-to-paste Shopify AI prompt that’s scoped, performant, and flexible as collections evolve.
    
    1. Layout Recommendation (what to build)
    Recommended: Image + Text Grid (Primary) + Text List (Secondary)
    
    Why this is the right balance for GH:
    
    Visual tiles help discovery + brand storytelling
    
    Text list keeps it scannable and SEO-friendly
    
    Future-proof when health goals change
    
    Works cleanly on mobile without feeling dense
    
    Lets homepage feature top 5, while this page shows everything
    
    Structure
    
    Above the fold
    
    Headline + short intro (mission-driven, non-clinical)
    
    Optional subhead reinforcing personalization
    
    Main section
    
    Responsive grid of collection cards
    
    Image
    
    Collection name
    
    1-line benefit descriptor
    
    Entire card clickable
    
    Secondary section (below grid)
    
    Simple text list of all health goals (alphabetical or grouped)
    
    Lightweight fallback for power users + SEO
    
    Why not list-only
    
    Feels utilitarian, not premium
    
    Misses education + brand opportunity
    
    Lower engagement for exploratory users
    
    Why not image-only
    
    Accessibility + SEO loss
    
    Harder to scan quickly
    
    Risky if images aren’t consistent yet
    
    2. Shopify AI Prompt (ready to paste)
    
    You can drop this directly into Shopify AI → Generate Page.
    
    SHOPIFY AI PROMPT
    
    Create a conversion-focused landing page that displays all product subcollections for a health and wellness brand.
    
    Page goal:
    Help customers explore and discover products by health goal in a clear, premium, and scannable way, while keeping the layout flexible as collections change over time.
    
    Brand tone:
    Calm, trustworthy, premium, educational, and customer-first. Avoid medical claims. Focus on support, balance, and holistic wellness.
    
    Page structure:
    
    Hero section
    
    Headline communicating personalization and wellness support
    
    Short supporting paragraph explaining that products are organized by health goals to help customers find what fits their needs
    
    Health Goals Collection Grid
    
    Responsive grid of collection cards
    
    Each card includes:
    
    Collection image
    
    Collection name
    
    Short 1-line descriptor (benefit-focused, non-clinical)
    
    Entire card should link to the collection page
    
    Grid should scale easily as collections are added or removed
    
    Browse All Health Goals (Text List)
    
    Clean, text-based list of all health goal collections below the grid
    
    Designed for quick scanning and SEO support
    
    CTA section
    
    Encourage users who aren’t sure where to start to browse all products or shop the full collection
    
    UX & design notes:
    
    Mobile-first layout
    
    Clean spacing, readable typography
    
    No heavy animations or scripts
    
    Fast-loading and accessible. make images and collection names link to /collections/collections
    
    Collections to include (can be placeholders):
    
    Cleanse & Detox
    
    Energy
    
    Brain Health
    
    Mood & Sleep
    
    Immune Health
    
    Gut Health
    
    Hormone Support
    
    Skin Care
    
    Use placeholder images and copy that can be easily swapped later.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-health-goals-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top }}px 0 {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom }}px;
  }

  .ai-health-goals-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.container_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  .ai-health-goals-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: {{ block.settings.text_alignment }};
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.header_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-health-goals-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .ai-health-goals-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.subheading_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-health-goals-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat({{ block.settings.columns_desktop }}, 1fr);
    gap: {{ block.settings.grid_gap }}px;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.list_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-health-goals-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    display: block;
    text-decoration: none;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_corner_radius }}px;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-health-goals-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
  }

  .ai-health-goals-card-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    padding-bottom: {{ block.settings.image_ratio }}%;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_corner_radius }}px;
  }

  .ai-health-goals-card-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .ai-health-goals-card-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .ai-health-goals-card-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: 16px 0;
  }

  .ai-health-goals-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.card_title_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .ai-health-goals-card-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.card_description_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-health-goals-text-list-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.list_background_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_corner_radius }}px;
    padding: 32px;
  }

  .ai-health-goals-list-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.list_heading_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-align: {{ block.settings.text_alignment }};
  }

  .ai-health-goals-list-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat({{ block.settings.list_columns_desktop }}, 1fr);
    gap: 12px 24px;
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-health-goals-list-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-health-goals-list-link-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.list_text_size }}px;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .ai-health-goals-list-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .ai-health-goals-cta-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: {{ block.settings.cta_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-health-goals-cta-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.cta_text_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }

  .ai-health-goals-cta-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 14px 32px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_background }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_border_radius }}px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_text_size }}px;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-health-goals-cta-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_background }};
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-health-goals-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }

    .ai-health-goals-list-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }

    .ai-health-goals-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: calc({{ block.settings.heading_size }}px * 0.85);
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-health-goals-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top | times: 0.7 }}px 0 {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom | times: 0.7 }}px;
    }

    .ai-health-goals-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: repeat({{ block.settings.columns_mobile }}, 1fr);
      gap: {{ block.settings.grid_gap | times: 0.75 }}px;
    }

    .ai-health-goals-list-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .ai-health-goals-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: calc({{ block.settings.heading_size }}px * 0.7);
    }

    .ai-health-goals-text-list-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 24px 20px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<health-goals-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-health-goals-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-health-goals-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.heading != blank or block.settings.subheading != blank %}
      <div class="ai-health-goals-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
          <h2 class="ai-health-goals-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading }}</h2>
        {% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.subheading != blank %}
          <div class="ai-health-goals-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.subheading }}</div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    {% if block.settings.show_grid %}
      <div class="ai-health-goals-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% for i in (1..8) %}
          {% liquid
            assign collection_key = 'collection_' | append: i
            assign title_key = 'collection_' | append: i | append: '_title'
            assign description_key = 'collection_' | append: i | append: '_description'
            assign image_key = 'collection_' | append: i | append: '_image'
            
            assign collection = block.settings[collection_key]
            assign custom_title = block.settings[title_key]
            assign custom_description = block.settings[description_key]
            assign custom_image = block.settings[image_key]
          %}

          {% if collection != blank %}
            <a href="{{ collection.url }}" class="ai-health-goals-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <div class="ai-health-goals-card-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {% if custom_image != blank %}
                  <img
                    src="{{ custom_image | image_url: width: 600 }}"
                    alt="{{ custom_image.alt | escape }}"
                    loading="lazy"
                    width="600"
                    height="{{ 600 | times: block.settings.image_ratio | divided_by: 100 }}"
                    class="ai-health-goals-card-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                  >
                {% elsif collection.image %}
                  <img
                    src="{{ collection.image | image_url: width: 600 }}"
                    alt="{{ collection.image.alt | escape }}"
                    loading="lazy"
                    width="600"
                    height="{{ 600 | times: block.settings.image_ratio | divided_by: 100 }}"
                    class="ai-health-goals-card-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                  >
                {% else %}
                  {{ 'collection-apparel-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
                {% endif %}
              </div>
              <div class="ai-health-goals-card-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <h3 class="ai-health-goals-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {% if custom_title != blank %}
                    {{ custom_title }}
                  {% else %}
                    {{ collection.title }}
                  {% endif %}
                </h3>
                {% if custom_description != blank %}
                  <p class="ai-health-goals-card-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ custom_description }}</p>
                {% endif %}
              </div>
            </a>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    {% if block.settings.show_text_list %}
      <div class="ai-health-goals-text-list-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.list_heading != blank %}
          <h3 class="ai-health-goals-list-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.list_heading }}</h3>
        {% endif %}
        <ul class="ai-health-goals-list-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% for i in (1..8) %}
            {% liquid
              assign collection_key = 'collection_' | append: i
              assign title_key = 'collection_' | append: i | append: '_title'
              
              assign collection = block.settings[collection_key]
              assign custom_title = block.settings[title_key]
            %}

            {% if collection != blank %}
              <li class="ai-health-goals-list-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <a href="{{ collection.url }}" class="ai-health-goals-list-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {% if custom_title != blank %}
                    {{ custom_title }}
                  {% else %}
                    {{ collection.title }}
                  {% endif %}
                </a>
              </li>
            {% endif %}
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    {% if block.settings.show_cta %}
      <div class="ai-health-goals-cta-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.cta_text != blank %}
          <p class="ai-health-goals-cta-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.cta_text }}</p>
        {% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.cta_button_text != blank and block.settings.cta_button_link != blank %}
          <a href="{{ block.settings.cta_button_link }}" class="ai-health-goals-cta-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.cta_button_text }}
          </a>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</health-goals-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class HealthGoals{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        this.setupAccessibility();
      }

      setupAccessibility() {
        const cards = this.querySelectorAll('.ai-health-goals-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        cards.forEach(card => {
          card.setAttribute('role', 'link');
        });
      }
    }

    customElements.define('health-goals-{{ ai_gen_id }}', HealthGoals{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

